## Architecture

- **[agent.py](file:///adapt/platform/novaops/frameworks/lang/deepagents-quickstarts/memory_agent/agent.py)**: Updated to import and initialize the new toolkits.
- **[tools/](file:///usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/langchain_community/chat_models/minimax.py#649-667)**: Modularized tool definitions.
    - [code_tools.py](file:///adapt/platform/novaops/frameworks/lang/deepagents-quickstarts/memory_agent/tools/code_tools.py): `PythonREPLTool`, `ShellTool`.
    - [db_tools.py](file:///adapt/platform/novaops/frameworks/lang/deepagents-quickstarts/memory_agent/tools/db_tools.py): `SQLDatabaseToolkit`.
    - [file_tools.py](file:///adapt/platform/novaops/frameworks/lang/deepagents-quickstarts/memory_agent/tools/file_tools.py): `FileManagementToolkit`.
    - [git_tools.py](file:///adapt/platform/novaops/frameworks/lang/deepagents-quickstarts/memory_agent/tools/git_tools.py): Custom git tools.
    - [research_tools.py](file:///adapt/platform/novaops/frameworks/lang/deepagents-quickstarts/memory_agent/tools/research_tools.py): `DuckDuckGoSearchRun`, `WikipediaQueryRun`.

